    <string name="game_advice_cod_tip_1">Prioritize the highest stable frame-rate option supported by your device; lower graphics quality if frame pacing becomes uneven.</string>
    <string name="game_advice_cod_tip_2">Turn off optional visual effects such as depth of field or ragdoll only if those controls exist in your version.</string>
    <string name="game_advice_common_tip_1">Use the phone maker’s built-in Game Mode if available and set it to performance.</string>
    <string name="game_advice_common_tip_2">Avoid gaming while the phone is very hot; remove a thick case and pause to cool down if performance drops with heat.</string>
